              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 150,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 88,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Set the LAN110 context, define the expected business-English outcomes, and connect corporate finance vocabulary to financial reporting tasks.</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#334155",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_a1wNxs34ed_outcomes",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 265,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 160,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Learning outcomes</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Use precise business-English vocabulary for finance and reporting</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Explain why reports support decisions by investors, managers, and creditors</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Prepare short spoken and written answers for LAN110 assessment tasks</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1f2937",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_a1wNxs34ed_assessment",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 455,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\">Assessment focus: explain the concept, apply it to a business example, and use accurate finance vocabulary.</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#4c1d95",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
